Add application and documentation icons.
Add a per-user desktop installer and uninstaller.
Show a green checkmark for passing tests and a red cross for failures.
Prevent duplicate test labels from overlapping the checkbox labels.
Find the Homebrew fakeroot binary when desktop launchers provide a limited PATH.
Keep completed test results visible when starting subsequent runs.
Show the app icon beside the title in the window header.
